warning: operation Cross drill: asks an optional stop after it, but this post script does not declare afterModes (it does not read PARAM AfterOperation) - set the operation to Continue or use a post that reads it
warning: operation Cross drill: is C-axis live-tool work (the spindle turns as C under a radial live tool), but this post script does not declare liveTooling - use a lathe post that voices the C axis
warning: tilted move - the Carvera post is 3-axis (the 4th axis module is not supported yet)
